OL,3,GNEWSAExplosives team called to rail
OL,4,Aline as trains are cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers are facing disruption due to
OL,7,Ftrains being cancelled after an object
OL,8,Fsuspected to be unexploded ordnance was
OL,9,Ffound near a rail line.
OL,11,FGreater Anglia trains between Norwich
OL,12,Fand Ely, including those running to
OL,13,FStansted Airport via Cambridge, have
OL,14,Fbeen cancelled until about 16:30 BST.
OL,16,FNorfolk Police was called at 09:52
OL,17,Fafter workers found the suspicious
OL,18,Fobject near Thetford. An Army explosive
OL,19,Fordnance disposal team has been called
OL,20,Fto the scene.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
