OL,3,GNEWSAExplosives team called to rail
OL,4,Aline as trains are cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Trains are unable to run between
OL,7,FNorwich and Ely until the area has been
OL,8,Fchecked and passed as safe," a Greater
OL,9,FAnglia spokesperson has said.
